name: Ouija — rank uniform
author: corpus
description: >-
  Ouija converts all cards in the deck to one random rank, then reduces hand size by 1.
  First-shop spectral rank engine: pair with rank payoffs (Baron, Shoot the Moon, Even
  Steven, Odd Todd) and Troubadour/Juggler to offset hand size.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - spectralCard: Ouija
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Baron
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: ShootTheMoon
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Juggler
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
